        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lord seeking new lands in which to expand your kingdom. You must explore all the lands, including wheat fields, lakes, and mountains, to spot the best plots, while competing with other lords to acquire them first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official adaptation of Kingdomino, the winner of the prestigious 2017 Spiel des Jahres award.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/931ed2c25646246d48825d1cf31d8a30.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.poster.avif?t=1778840091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.webm?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.mp4?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle quick-witted AI opponents, join competitive online multiplayer matches, or team up with friends. Conquer the 7x7 Mighty Duel for hardcore strategy fans, or complete 15+ unique quest challenges to test your tactical skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/11a7fc3d3fa04239cf559ec47438a2a8.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b5deae0579b7ea47d5844ce69480b3cf.poster.avif?t=1778840091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b5deae0579b7ea47d5844ce69480b3cf.webm?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b5deae0579b7ea47d5844ce69480b3cf.mp4?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solo expedition through mysterious, uncharted territories! Discover domino pieces to gain exclusive rewards, and build your empire in this game mode designed around exploration and progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/959b88c2c2d8e382cf71e271d3a11f8a.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a thriving gaming community in seasonal events and daily challenges! Collaborate with players worldwide to unlock exclusive limited-time rewards. Complete special quest objectives, earn community points, and participate in time-limited events that bring players together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/0f91f404b0fe77382fd1a49f8bc470ad.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.poster.avif?t=1778840091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.webm?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.mp4?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved game with both versions of Kingdomino, choose between the new Kingdomino artwork by Pauline Détraz, or the Classic Kingdomino artwork by Cyril Bouquet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect unique Meeples and Castle designs to make your realm truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/7c609ecb4491961829c4073ebe974217.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless multiplayer gaming across all devices. Challenge friends and rivals, whether they're playing on PC or mobile - True cross-platform compatibility ensures you'll always find opponents ready to battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player builds a kingdom by connecting domino-like tiles showing different terrains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominoes have two squares with different or matching landscapes, some featuring crowns that multiply points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with your castle tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns selecting from available terrain tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect tiles to matching landscapes (forests, fields, lakes, mountains)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategically to create large territories with multiple crowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by multiplying territory size by the number of crowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games take 10-20 minutes, making Kingdomino perfect for quick sessions or hours of strategic kingdom building!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lord seeking new lands in which to expand your kingdom. You must explore all the lands, including wheat fields, lakes, and mountains, to spot the best plots, while competing with other lords to acquire them first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official adaptation of Kingdomino, the winner of the prestigious 2017 Spiel des Jahres award.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/931ed2c25646246d48825d1cf31d8a30.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.poster.avif?t=1778840091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.webm?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.mp4?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle quick-witted AI opponents, join competitive online multiplayer matches, or team up with friends. Conquer the 7x7 Mighty Duel for hardcore strategy fans, or complete 15+ unique quest challenges to test your tactical skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/11a7fc3d3fa04239cf559ec47438a2a8.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b5deae0579b7ea47d5844ce69480b3cf.poster.avif?t=1778840091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b5deae0579b7ea47d5844ce69480b3cf.webm?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/b5deae0579b7ea47d5844ce69480b3cf.mp4?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solo expedition through mysterious, uncharted territories! Discover domino pieces to gain exclusive rewards, and build your empire in this game mode designed around exploration and progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/959b88c2c2d8e382cf71e271d3a11f8a.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a thriving gaming community in seasonal events and daily challenges! Collaborate with players worldwide to unlock exclusive limited-time rewards. Complete special quest objectives, earn community points, and participate in time-limited events that bring players together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/0f91f404b0fe77382fd1a49f8bc470ad.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.poster.avif?t=1778840091\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.webm?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/869390d9aa82a348bad51ce7be33cc0d.mp4?t=1778840091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved game with both versions of Kingdomino, choose between the new Kingdomino artwork by Pauline Détraz, or the Classic Kingdomino artwork by Cyril Bouquet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect unique Meeples and Castle designs to make your realm truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3029180/extras/7c609ecb4491961829c4073ebe974217.avif?t=1778840091\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless multiplayer gaming across all devices. Challenge friends and rivals, whether they're playing on PC or mobile - True cross-platform compatibility ensures you'll always find opponents ready to battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player builds a kingdom by connecting domino-like tiles showing different terrains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominoes have two squares with different or matching landscapes, some featuring crowns that multiply points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with your castle tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns selecting from available terrain tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect tiles to matching landscapes (forests, fields, lakes, mountains)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategically to create large territories with multiple crowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by multiplying territory size by the number of crowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games take 10-20 minutes, making Kingdomino perfect for quick sessions or hours of strategic kingdom building!</p>",
        "short_description": "Kingdomino is a cosy 1-4 player tile-laying strategy game of kingdom building. Place colorful dominoes, match terrains, and crown your lands to create the most prosperous realm. Simple to learn yet deeply strategic game perfect for quick sessions, solo challenges, or competitive multiplayer.",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Hungarian, Korean",
        "reviews": "“Perfectly captures the board game!”<br>4/5 – Pocket Gamer<br><br>“Kingdomino on PC is a faithful and polished adaptation that emphasizes the source material’s convenience, speed, and accessibility.”<br>4/5 – Tech-Gaming<br><br>“I can honestly say that Kingdomino has become one of my favorite digital board games. For someone like me, who had never played the physical board game, the digital version feels flawless. In the end, Kingdomino is an incredible game. The digital app is a fantastic way to experience it, offering a fast, polished, and addictive version of a truly brilliant board game.”<br>9/10 – Movies Games and Tech<br>",
